      "role": "tool",
      "state": "{'type': 'text', 'text': \"<h1>Retail shelves were 'very well replenished' on Black Friday</h1>\\n<p class='meta'>Source: Yahoo | Date: 2025-12-01 12:24 | Symbol: WMT</p>\\n<p>As Cyber Monday shopping is in full swing, Coresight Research Head of Global Research John Mercer comments on the state of retailer's and department store's inventory management in the first phase of the holiday shopping season. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\\xa0Market Catalysts.</p>\\n<p>According to Yahoo, retail shelves were 'very well replenished' on black friday. \\n                        This development has significant implications for investors tracking \\n                        WMT.</p>\\n<p>Market analysts are closely monitoring this situation as it could impact \\n                        trading strategies in the coming weeks. Investors are advised to review \\n                        their positions and consider the broader market context.</p>\\n<p>As Cyber Monday shopping is in full swing, Coresight Research Head of Global Research John Mercer comments on the state of retailer's and department store's inventory management in the first phase of the holiday shopping season. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\\xa0Market Catalysts.</p>\"}",
